name: |-
  vgTime
desc: |-
  某些APP要清除缓存或者重新安装拦截广告才会生效！
author: |-
  奶思
icon: |-
  https://github.com/Toperlock/Quantumult/raw/main/icon/Doraemon/Doraemon-1009.png
category: |-
  奶思的模块
